    <item>
      <title>Organise with Pouches</title>
      <link>https://kwk-cli.github.io/docs/pouches/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 08 Mar 2016 21:07:13 +0100</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://kwk-cli.github.io/docs/pouches/</guid>
      <description>

&lt;h2 id=&#34;stopping-the-mess&#34;&gt;Stopping the mess&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Pouches make categorizing snippets easy and provide a way to make a group of snippets private. Pouches have at most 24 snippets.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 id=&#34;create-a-pouch&#34;&gt;Create a pouch&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34;&gt;kwk mkdir big-project
# kwk mkdir &amp;lt;pouch name&amp;gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;h3 id=&#34;view-a-pouch&#34;&gt;View a pouch&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34;&gt;kwk big-project
# kwk &amp;lt;pouch name&amp;gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;h3 id=&#34;delete-a-pouch&#34;&gt;Delete a pouch&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34;&gt;kwk rm &amp;lt;pouch name&amp;gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;h3 id=&#34;make-a-pouch-private&#34;&gt;Make a pouch private&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34;&gt;kwk lock &amp;lt;pouch name&amp;gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;h3 id=&#34;make-a-pouch-public&#34;&gt;Make a pouch public&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34;&gt;kwk unlock &amp;lt;pouch name&amp;gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;h3 id=&#34;rename-a-pouch&#34;&gt;Rename a pouch&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34;&gt;kwk mv &amp;lt;pouch name&amp;gt; &amp;lt;new pouch name&amp;gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;h3 id=&#34;delete-a-pouch-1&#34;&gt;Delete a pouch&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34;&gt;kwk rm &amp;lt;pouch name&amp;gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
</description>
